      {
        "h_title": "Chumphon",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Chumphon",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "The provincial capital has a reasonable selection of guesthouses, hostels and hotels located within walking distance of the train station. You’ll also find places to stay on several of the mainland beaches -- see the beaches listing for hints.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/sight_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/3533",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/sight_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/3533",
                "anchor_text": "beaches listing"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Euro Boutique Hotel",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Chumphon",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "A convenient location with clean and comfortable rooms at reasonable rates make Euro Boutique Hotel a top pick in Chumphon town.\nStanding six storeys tall and painted two shades of blue, the featureless concrete building is set back from busy Kromluang Road, less than a kilometre east of the train station. The bland design makes this one of many examples of hotels misusing the word... Read our full review of Euro Boutique Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8009",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8009",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Euro Boutique Hotel including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Euro Boutique Hotel",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8009",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8009",
                "anchor_text": "Euro Boutique Hotel"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Retro Box Hotel",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Chumphon",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Joining a growing movement of hostels built out of renovated shipping containers, Retro Box has by far the flashiest setup of all the budget accommodation found in Chumphon town. The centrepiece is a moderately sized swimming pool set between a pair of two-storey stacks of shipping containers painted yellow and orange. A mixed six-bed dorm room is situated on an upper floor off a hallway, so... Read our full review of Retro Box Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8010",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8010",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Retro Box Hotel including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Retro Box Hotel",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8010",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8010",
                "anchor_text": "Retro Box Hotel"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Villa Varich",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Chumphon",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Shrouded in coconut trees along the Tha Thapap River, Villa Varich offers a taste of the countryside within a few km of Chumphon town. The helpful owners make it a worthwhile choice even if you don’t have a vehicle. The brushed-cement and wooden rooms at this small resort were designed to complement the natural surroundings, providing an entirely different experience compared to the city... Read our full review of Villa Varich including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8824",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8824",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Villa Varich including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Villa Varich",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/chumphon/chumphon/all/8824",
            "urls": [
